OL,3,GNEWSAPolice close to identifying youths
OL,4,Aattacking ducks
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they are close to
OL,7,Fidentifying a a group of young people
OL,8,Fwho have been targeting ducks with
OL,9,Fcatapults.
OL,11,FHalf a dozen attacks on ducks in
OL,12,FDorchester, Dorset, have been reported
OL,13,Fso far this year, with a number of
OL,14,Fducks found injured and dead along the
OL,15,FRiver Frome.
OL,17,FThe spate of attacks led to locals
OL,18,Festablishing the Dorchester Duck Patrol
OL,19,Fin the spring, in the hopes of ending
OL,20,Fthe attacks on wildlife.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
